{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115","id":387308742,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzODczMDg3NDI=","number":1115,"title":"Issue with throwing a more specific exception than listed in docblock","user":{"login":"aidantwoods","id":3288888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg4ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3288888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods","html_url":"https://github.com/aidantwoods","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-12-04T14:20:56Z","updated_at":"2018-12-06T11:58:07Z","closed_at":"2018-12-06T03:50:21Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using `checkForThrowsDocblock`, if a function says that it throws a `BaseCustomException` via the `@throws` annotation, and then explicitly throws a `DerivedCustomException` (which extends `BaseCustomException`) then Psalm complains that the `DerivedCustomException` wasn't caught/listed via `@throws`. IMO it should be sufficient to list just the parent exception, since `DerivedCustomException` *is* a `BaseCustomException`.\r\n\r\nhttps://getpsalm.org/r/3e621b8e63\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n\r\nclass BaseCustomException extends \\Exception\r\n{}\r\n\r\nclass DerivedCustomException extends BaseCustomException\r\n{}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * @throws BaseCustomException\r\n */\r\nfunction foo(int $n): bool\r\n{\r\n    if ($n < 0) {\r\n        throw new DerivedCustomException;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    return ($n > 1);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nPsalm output (using commit 93662ab): \r\n```\r\nINFO: MissingThrowsDocblock - 12:1 - DerivedCustomException is thrown but not caught - please either catch or add a @throws annotation\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1115/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}